/// Aggregated data sourced from (All) DOR-AJCC Collab_GrantParticipants file. Contains demographic and program details for individuals enrolled in a workforce program, including  region (LWDB), disability status, employment status, and key dates such as Grant Enrollment Date and Exit Date. This is the primary fact table for enrollment-based measures.
table Participants
	lineageTag: 746f207c-5c43-44d7-868a-d6d48bf2d38b

	/// The date the participant exited the program. A non-null value indicates the participant has left.
	column 'EXIT DATE'
		dataType: dateTime
